This project fine-tunes a LoRA adapter on top of the Qwen3.5-4B base model (https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B),
which is released under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The base model weights are not included in this repository;
they are downloaded from their original location at run time.
